# UI

Build screens from the shadcn components in `src/components/ui`. Do not add a parallel button, input, dialog, table, or card style in CSS.

This is an HR ledger, not a marketing page. Graphite surfaces, Inter for text, IBM Plex Mono for money, teal only on the save action and the focus ring. Keep the workflow in `docs/PRD.md`: search, country and department filters, currency totals, and the salary editor.
